@startuml
title 003 學生提交答案 - 時序圖
actor "學生" as Student
actor "老師介面" as TeacherUI
participant "React UI / RealtimeClient" as UI
participant "RealtimeHub" as Hub
participant "BuzzerResultsService" as Results
participant "ActivityState" as Activity
participant "GroupRoster" as Groups

Student -> UI : 加入有效組別
UI -> Hub : student.join(groupId)
Hub -> Groups : 驗證組別
Hub --> UI : student.joined + activity.snapshot
Hub --> UI : buzzerResults.questionList(questionIds)

opt 準備階段有新題號匯入
  TeacherUI -> Hub : guidedNotes.import(...)
  Hub -> Activity : 更新活動題號
  Hub ->> UI : 只向已加入學生更新 questionList
end

Student -> UI : 選題並送出原始答案
UI -> Hub : submitAnswer(questionId, answerText)
Hub -> Hub : 驗證 STUDENT 並讀取連線 groupId
Hub -> Groups : 驗證組別
Hub -> Results : submitAnswer(groupId, questionId, answerText)
Results -> Activity : 檢查 BUZZING 及活動題號
Results -> Results : 檢查非空白、唯一鍵並同步 check-and-set
alt 身分、階段、題號或答案無效
  Results --> Hub : 對應錯誤；不改變狀態或順序
  Hub --> UI : error(requestId, code, message)
else 首筆有效答案
  Results -> Results : 保留原文、鎖定並配置 receivedOrder
  Results -> Results : 以最小 receivedOrder 推導勝者
  Results --> Hub : accepted submission
  Hub --> UI : buzzerResults.submitted(accepted, locked)
  Hub ->> TeacherUI : teacher-only 完整 teacherProgress
end

note over Student,TeacherUI
BUZZING 中學生只收到本組接受確認或錯誤；
教師登入時先收到全量快照，每筆有效答案後收到更新。
end note
@enduml
